1780   0B09             ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
1781   0B09             ; ASTRO_JUPITER_RUN
1782   0B09             ; Re-read the RTC if it is valid.  If the RTC is bad, keep the manual
1783   0B09             ; session time entered at startup.  Then compute today's rise/set and the
1784   0B09             ; current azimuth/elevation, and enter the five-screen ENTER rotation.
1785   0B09             ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
1786   0B09             ASTRO_JUPITER_RUN:
1787   0B09 3A 00 89            LD A,(AST_CLOCK_OK)
1788   0B0C B7                  OR A
