3524   167C             ASTRO_UMUL16:
3525   167C                     ; PURE Z80 FAST unsigned HL * DE -> 32-bit M32_ACC.
3526   167C                     ; Product is accumulated in HL:IX, avoiding four-byte RAM shifts and
3527   167C                     ; helper CALLs for every multiplier bit. No Z180 MLT is used.
3528   167C DD E5               PUSH IX
3529   167E E5                  PUSH HL
