5288   3AED 3A 4F 89            LD A,(AST_INPUT_MODE)
5289   3AF0 B7                  OR A
5290   3AF1 20 0B               JR NZ,G_PRS_TIME
5291   3AF3 21 62 1A            LD HL,MSG_DATE_PREFIX
