7125   47B5             
7126   47B5             ; Full trial retained only for the educated |EL|/15-hour jump, because that
7127   47B5             ; stage genuinely needs elevation magnitude to choose the next coarse step.
7128   47B5             ; Carry set = polarity changed (horizon bracketed).
7129   47B5             G_EF_TRY_STEP_FULL:
