7913   4E10 22 28 89            LD (AST_SET),HL
7914   4E13 C9                  RET
7915   4E14             
7916   4E14             ; Input HL=coarse crossing minute (multiple of 10), FFFF unchanged.
7917   4E14             ; Returns refined minute by scanning coarse-10..coarse at 1-minute resolution.
7918   4E14             G_REFINE_CROSS:
7919   4E14 7C                  LD A,H
7920   4E15 FE FF               CP $FF
7921   4E17 C8                  RET Z
7922   4E18 11 0A 00            LD DE,10
7923   4E1B B7                  OR A
